      "id": "kpk1-l21-a1-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l21-a1-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Urodziny i imieniny"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Urodziny* is a birthday, the day you were born. *Imieniny* is a name day: every Polish name has its own day in the calendar, and on it everyone with that name celebrates. Both words are plural: *moje urodziny*, *twoje imieniny*. To celebrate is *obchodzić*: *obchodzę imieniny w maju*. A present *z okazji urodzin* is a present for a birthday."
      }
    }
  ],
